Still in your `main.wasp` file, add the auth configuration.
In our case, we would make use of sign-in by `usernameAndPassword`:
```
app wasptutorial {
wasp: {
version: "^0.13.1"
},
title: "wasptutorial",
auth: {
userEntity: User,
methods: {
// Enable username and password auth.
usernameAndPassword: {}
},
onAuthFailedRedirectTo: "/login"
}
