```
...
Next, you need to create routes for both sign-in and login.
Modify the `main.wasp` file with the code below:
```
// main.wasp
...
route SignupRoute { path: "/signup", to: SignupPage }
page SignupPage {
component: import { SignupPage } from "@src/SignupPage"
}
route LoginRoute { path: "/login", to: LoginPage }
page LoginPage {
component: import { LoginPage } from "@src/LoginPage"
}
```
...
Setting `authRequired` to `true` will make sure that all unauthenticated users will be redirected to the login page we just created.

